                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "Every colour token carries an HC value on the Contrast axis, re-derived from the shipped SurfaceTheme.highContrast by preserving lightness and dropping the blue tint. Floors held: border-default >= 3:1 vs bg-raised (WCAG 1.4.11), text-secondary\/tertiary >= 4.5:1 vs bg-raised (1.4.3), state hues brighten (signal-rec ff1744 -> ff5470). opacity-disabled rises 0.4 -> 0.62 and opacity-trace-dim 0.28 -> 0.5 so their product stays legible."
